  "abstract": "Covers the SPIFFE standards for issuers, workloads, validators and federation operators: SPIFFE ID syntax and trust domain names, SVID trust and assertion safety, X.509-SVID certificate rules and leaf validation, JWT-SVID header, claims, validation and transmission, trust domain bundles and bundle maps, the Workload Endpoint and Workload API profiles, federation bundle endpoints with the https_web and https_spiffe profiles, and the Incubating WIT-SVID. Maps the standards to SPIRE server, agent, attestation, registration entries and federation configuration. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out SPIFFE IDs, X.509-SVID, JWT-SVID, bundles, the Workload API, federation, SPIRE and WIT-SVID.",
